## Hello!

I am AN HA, a programmer passionate about systems programming, operating systems, and distributed systems.
I enjoy exploring the depths of computer science and sharing my knowledge through this blog.

Welcome to my blog! I'm a software engineer passionate about systems programming, operating systems, and distributed computing.

You can find me on [GitHub](https://github.com/bannnn511) or connect with me through my work.

This blog contains my notes on:
- Systems programming and operating systems
- Research paper summaries and analyses
- Implementation details and technical explorations
- xv6 kernel hacking and modifications

The research papers section includes my analysis and summaries of important papers in systems and distributed computing.

